# XS Language

For any XS-related task, apply the single canonical skill at
`xs-language/SKILL.md` before reading, explaining, writing, reviewing, or
debugging code. Do not ask the user to run a skill command.

Use only this repository's local sources listed by the skill. Do not rely on
another repository or create a second copy of the skill.

**Hard rule — cast + `..`:** never write `(Type)obj..Member`; always
`(Type)(obj..Member)` or avoid the cast. See skill section
"CRITICAL — cast binds tighter than `..`".

**Hard rule — Site `@` globals:** assign only in Site output/`config` blocks;
never read them inside `func`/`void` — pass values as parameters. Many settings
→ one `@cfg = new { ... }` object. See skill section "`@` globals in Site mode".
